{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land of the Valiant</strong> is a survival RPG set in a world consumed by scarcity and ruin.<br>In the aftermath of the Age of Shadows, every choice can mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path alone \u2014 facing hunger, fear, and the moral weight of your actions \u2014 or build alliances by joining a guild, where unity brings strength, but freedom has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, hunt, and fight to endure in a land where resources are dwindling, trust is fragile, and the shadows of mankind are more dangerous than the beasts that roam the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step tells a story.<br>Every decision shapes your fate.<br><strong>Will you survive the world... or become what destroyed it?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920400?t=1763478860","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920400/570f9f679df5097cadec06cdea8b476acbfa4f3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763478860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920400/d5534d18a743dd17f22604a2b6f351930356d83c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763478860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920400/d5534d18a743dd17f22604a2b6f351930356d83c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763478860","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains stylized cartoon violence typical of fantasy RPGs. Combat includes t